     NOISE TUNING - Agent 006 (ho-sr-01)
     Applied: 2026-04-08
     Target: rule 40704 systemd noise
     ========================================= -->

<group name="noise_tuning,">

  <!-- Suppress rule 40704 for hawkinsops-pull.service recurring timer failure.
       Root cause: timer runs every 15min, service fails because upstream
       infrastructure (CIFS mount, rsync targets) is broken since 2026-03-20.
